{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc02_4kings_b_02.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc02_4kings_b_02.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_20",
      "hash64": "0446FEFE877B9DC5",
      "text": "你挑战联盟，\\n是特例中的特例……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_21",
      "hash64": "0446FDFE877B9C12",
      "text": "纳莉我反对过，\\n但学园许可的事，即为规则。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_22",
      "hash64": "0446FCFE877B9A5F",
      "text": "纳莉我作为四天王要做的\\n就是顺利推进此事而已。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_01",
      "hash64": "044D89FE8780F5A4",
      "text": "四天王挑战\\n在此地进行。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_02",
      "hash64": "044D8CFE8780FABD",
      "text": "纳莉我构思的挑战是\\n……[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]飞翔计时赛[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_03",
      "hash64": "044D8BFE8780F90A",
      "text": "你需要借助坐骑宝可梦的飞行能力，\\n在巨蛋上空按路线飞行。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_04",
      "hash64": "044D86FE8780F08B",
      "text": "在限制时间内\\n到达终点，就算通过。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_05",
      "hash64": "044D85FE8780EED8",
      "text": "如果钻过小磁怪的圆环\\n就会延长限制时间。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_06",
      "hash64": "044D88FE8780F3F1",
      "text": "建议你在朝终点前进的途中\\n尽可能地钻过圆环。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_07",
      "hash64": "044D87FE8780F23E",
      "text": "飞翔计时赛，\\n你能否挑战？[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "08F660377601C01F",
      "text": "我要挑战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "08F661377601C1D2",
      "text": "听说明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "08F662377601C385",
      "text": "下次吧",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_08",
      "hash64": "044D82FE8780E9BF",
      "text": "我知道了。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_23",
      "hash64": "0446FBFE877B98AC",
      "text": "请准备好同行的\\n坐骑宝可梦。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_01",
      "hash64": "CCD579CEDD8CCEC4",
      "text": "啊嘎嘶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_24",
      "hash64": "0446FAFE877B96F9",
      "text": "……不错，看起来是努努力\\n就能飞起来的宝可梦。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_25",
      "hash64": "0446F9FE877B9546",
      "text": "小啊嘎嘶，\\n吃下这个。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_02",
      "hash64": "CCD57CCEDD8CD3DD",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_03",
      "hash64": "CCD57BCEDD8CD22A",
      "text": "啊嘎～嘶！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_01",
      "hash64": "4DB9FEED184A976C",
      "text": "故勒顿\\n充满了力量！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_02",
      "hash64": "4DBA01ED184A9C85",
      "text": "密勒顿\\n充满了力量！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_26",
      "hash64": "0446F8FE877B9393",
      "text": "这是生长在巨蛋内的\\n神奇的叶子……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_27",
      "hash64": "0446F7FE877B91E0",
      "text": "我将其调和并制作成了\\n能增强飞行能力的药丸。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_28",
      "hash64": "044706FE877BAB5D",
      "text": "仅限挑战时\\n可以在上空自由飞行。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_29",
      "hash64": "044705FE877BA9AA",
      "text": "那么，请开始挑战吧。\\n……祝你武运昌隆。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_09",
      "hash64": "044D81FE8780E80C",
      "text": "你完美地恪守了时间。\\n真是让人看得舒畅的飞行。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_10",
      "hash64": "044A84FE877EB74E",
      "text": "那么，四天王挑战通过。\\n嗯，恭喜你。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_19",
      "hash64": "044A7DFE877EAB69",
      "text": "又要换个地方了。\\n……跟我来。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_11",
      "hash64": "044A85FE877EB901",
      "text": "挑战失败了。\\c\\n不守时的人\\n是守不了任何事物的。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_12",
      "hash64": "044A82FE877EB3E8",
      "text": "想再挑战的话，\\n就再来吧。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_13",
      "hash64": "044A83FE877EB59B",
      "text": "挑战又失败了……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_14",
      "hash64": "044A88FE877EBE1A",
      "text": "但是不知为何，\\n纳莉我……开始烦恼了。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_15",
      "hash64": "044A89FE877EBFCD",
      "text": "你哪怕多次失败\\n也要不断挑战的身姿……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_16",
      "hash64": "044A86FE877EBAB4",
      "text": "或许是比在规定时间内\\n到达终点更尊贵的行为。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_30",
      "hash64": "044378FE8778843C",
      "text": "……就破例算你\\n挑战通过吧。\\r\\n我觉得很适合特例不断的你。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_17",
      "hash64": "044A87FE877EBC67",
      "text": "对战的时候我可不会\\n手下留情，千万不要大意。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_stop_01",
      "hash64": "A7A1EB09FF048717",
      "text": "要放弃\\n飞翔计时赛吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
